# Contract v1.3: the composition shows only in the panel's input line (pinyin with syllable spaces, a draft as
# "improve › ok"), never as marked text in the field; the field gets text only on commit.
NAME switching to ABC commits pinyin once and hides its panel
PROFILES all
LANG chinese
TEXT "Hi |"
TYPE nihao
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT preedit "ni hao"
SWITCH abc
EXPECT doc "Hi 你好"
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT preedit none
EXPECT panel hidden
EXPECT nolost
